patients with leukopenia,

24
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:29,970
or after treatment with
immunosuppressive agents.

25
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:34,610
Pneumonia develops when
local defense mechanisms

26
00:01:34,610 --> 00:01:37,010
are impaired, for
example, in patients

27
00:01:37,010 --> 00:01:40,730
with loss or suppression
of the cough reflex.

28
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:43,050
For example,

29
00:01:44,090 --> 00:01:48,210
this is seen in comatose
patients, in patients under

30
00:01:48,210 --> 00:01:51,610
