neuromuscular disorders,

31
00:01:51,610 --> 00:01:55,430
or in patients with aspiration
of gastric contents.

32
00:01:57,010 --> 00:02:00,670
Pneumonia is associated with
dysfunction of the mucus

33
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:06,370
ciliary apparatus, for
example, in those that smoke,

34
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:10,330
in patients with
inhalation of hot or

35
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:13,890
