viral diseases or genetic

36
00:02:13,890 --> 00:02:17,330
defects of ciliary
function, for example,

37
00:02:17,370 --> 00:02:21,390
in those with immotile
cilia syndrome.

38
00:02:22,810 --> 00:02:26,870
Frequently, pneumonia
is described in patients

39
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:29,630
with cystic fibrosis and
bronchial obstruction,

40
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:31,990
both conditions characterized

41
00:02:31,990 --> 00:02:34,130
by accumulation of secretions.

42
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:38,670
A high risk for
pneumonia is noted if

43
00:02:38,670 --> 00:02:43,410
