blocked by alcohol,

45
00:02:46,650 --> 00:02:51,430
tobacco, smoke, anoxia,
or oxygen intoxication.

46
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:55,490
Pneumonia is also
described in patients

47
00:02:55,490 --> 00:02:57,810
with pulmonary
edema or congestion.

48
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:10,390
The most important types
