49
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,090
here. So we have
community-acquired acute

50
00:03:13,090 --> 00:03:17,390
pneumonia, which can be
bacterial or interstitial.

51
00:03:17,390 --> 00:03:21,230
Then we can have healthcare
associate pneumonia and

52
00:03:21,230 --> 00:03:24,890
hospital acquired pneumonia,
aspiration pneumonia. And

53
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:29,510
then we have chronic pneumonias,
including necrotizing

54
00:03:29,510 --> 00:03:33,310
type and lung abscesses.
And there is a specific type

55
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:37,230
of pneumonia which is going
