area of central casiation.

641
00:40:27,290 --> 00:40:30,770
In the cases with the
favorable evolution,

642
00:40:30,770 --> 00:40:33,610
the extent of the
necrosis is limited,

643
00:40:33,610 --> 00:40:36,910
and there is no
bronchial destruction or

644
00:40:36,910 --> 00:40:40,320
