bronchus whatsoever.

645
00:40:41,710 --> 00:40:44,830
Interestingly, the
active lesion is in

646
00:40:44,830 --> 00:40:47,690
fact an acute pneumonia
with cavitation.

647
00:40:48,610 --> 00:40:53,530
Also, I have to mention
the controversy regarding

648
00:40:53,530 --> 00:40:57,870
these active lesions as some
authors have found evidence

649
00:40:57,870 --> 00:41:02,010
that these lesions represent
exogenous reinfection.

650
00:41:02,230 --> 00:41:03,550
However,

651
00:41:04,030 --> 00:41:05,990
the presence of a fibrotic scar

652
00:41:05,990 --> 00:41:08,910
supports the
reactivation theory.

653
00:41:09,550 --> 00:41:14,650
Scar is equivalent in this
context with chronicity.

654
00:41:15,730 --> 00:41:20,170
The right side microphotograph
