these cells cannot kill

697
00:43:46,210 --> 00:43:50,170
the organism without involvement
of lymphocytes type T.

698
00:43:50,870 --> 00:43:54,890
Initially, the macrophages
are not activated,

699
00:43:54,890 --> 00:43:58,970
although they are infected.
In health individuals,

700
00:43:58,970 --> 00:44:02,190
the infection is counteracted
by T-cell immunity

701
00:44:02,190 --> 00:44:07,800
and activation of Th1
helper cells These cells

702
00:44:07,800 --> 00:44:11,370
secrete interferon gamma,
which will activate

703
00:44:11,370 --> 00:44:16,270
